-- What the informal proofs of sag/zmt-lifting-general open, declaration by
-- declaration (seg/WRITING.md, rule 6).  Each list was compared with the
-- file comment of its declaration: the notions the proof is about
-- (mulP, pmul, coef, comps, ...), and the carriers of the modules it
-- works in (Chart.mod/El, SubMod.mod/E, Prod.mod/El, Fam.C1/C2, regular,
-- TPoly: 'an element of C^q(k) is a finitely supported family', 'a
-- polynomial is a list of terms').  In the two instances the Int twists
-- -1 - 3 = -4 etc. are identified by computation (sucZ, sucNeg, three, ..).
